{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you a prey or predator, a world where magic moves you through the islands of void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect the Finish ORB, then when magic is disabled;  find the exit lamp to move you to the next island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 3d platformer of a small inhabitant of the void island, who is able to transcend to other floating void islands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge enemies and complete the levels as a passifist animal, but other void creatures are not the same and may attack or defend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">68 Void slands to explore, C++ Beach Engine 1.5. Developed by hojiin studios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LAN SETTINGS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It should work out the box, but if you're using paid antivirus, which controls your firewall you may have to create a rule for the .exe in order to play COOP (and you're hosting).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Found first enemy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821250/480e613e6f7e935edf51c50553edfcb52d0b3599.jpg"},{"name":"Completed first world","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821250/b20d7eaebf31f05d28b23d519b78565d26616d19.jpg"},{"name":"Jumped through 30 portals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821250/fc3a66db125b1481708e22797792ed3536a94903.jpg"},{"name":"Entered last world","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821250/f86d5104becb4eb51e5805ec757a09168252dc47.jpg"},{"name":"Entered new world","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821250/f86d5104becb4eb51e5805ec757a09168252dc47.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2821250?t=